3481.description:
Multiplayer adventures will always be in high demand, even if they resemble traditional arcade games. For example, today you have the opportunity to play Retimed and head to arenas designed for player-versus-player combat. Each arena can accommodate two to four players, who must kill other players, accumulate points, and climb to the top of the leaderboard. To achieve success, players can use standard pistols, slow-motion effects, and sleight of hand.

However, don't forget about the unique features of the gameplay experience. For example, during combat, you'll be able to use certain elements of the environment. If bullets hit each other, they ricochet. Be sure to pay attention to the color of incoming projectiles; if they're the same color as you, they won't cause any harm. Not to mention the complete freedom of movement, the ability to dodge, and use various bonuses that appear in the arena. Now all this is available for your use; all you need to do is download the game. Retimed via torrent in Russian and you can begin a desperate confrontation.

Game features
- dynamic gameplay;
- a lot of tactical possibilities;
- invigorating battles;
- nice graphics;
- the opportunity to compete for the best places in the ranking.

Installation:
1. Download and unzip the game
2. Run the file Retimed.exe
3. Play.
